sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant I as Investor
    participant UI as Web App
    participant RC as RecommendationController
    participant RS as RiskScorer
    participant RE as RecommendationEngine
    participant AS as AllocationStrategy
    participant SEL as AssetSelector
    participant MD as MarketDataProvider
    participant DB as Database
    I->>UI: Enter budget, goal, horizon
    UI->>RC: POST /recommendations
    RC->>DB: Load latest RiskProfile
    alt No risk profile or profile is stale
        RC-->>UI: 409 Take the risk quiz
        UI->>I: Show risk quiz
        I->>UI: Submit answers
        UI->>RC: POST /risk-profile
        RC->>RS: score(answers, horizonYears)
        RS-->>RC: RiskProfile
        RC->>DB: Save RiskProfile
    end
    RC->>RE: recommend(budget, goal, profile)
    RE->>AS: targetWeights(profile)
    AS-->>RE: weights per asset class
    loop For each asset class
        RE->>SEL: select(assetClass, n, rules)
        SEL->>MD: getPrice(symbol)
        MD-->>SEL: latest price
        SEL-->>RE: ranked assets within caps
    end
    RE->>RE: sizePositions(), explain()
    RE-->>RC: Recommendation (PROPOSED)
    RC->>DB: Save Recommendation
    RC-->>UI: 200 plan with reasons
    UI-->>I: Show allocation and "Why this?"
    opt Investor edits the plan
        I->>UI: Change amount or remove an asset
        UI->>RC: PUT /recommendations/{id}
        RC->>RE: recalculate(recommendation)
        RE-->>RC: Updated Recommendation
        RC-->>UI: Updated plan
    end
